Bug Triage Workflow (v1.0.0)
  Assess, fix, and validate bug reports against the codebase with per-bug 
reports stored under .specify/bugs/<slug>/

Provided commands:
  • speckit.bug.assess - Assess a bug report (pasted text or URL) against the 
codebase and produce an assessment with possible remediation
  • speckit.bug.fix - Apply the remediation from a bug assessment and record 
what was changed
  • speckit.bug.test - Validate that a previously fixed bug is resolved and 
record the verification report

⚠  Configuration may be required
